{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0554_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8e4135591c5dbb6e12297bf05f717420eb60bda563c3b166bfc35670f4bc511a", "ja": "（今日は環のプライベートブランドの服の試着日だ。\nフィッティングは、どうやら終わったみたいだな）", "zh": "（今天是试穿环自有品牌服装的日子。试衣好像已经结束了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0554_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "f17df7cf80079a1fb61f3a001bcea6a3f9de92c47306ca2b9bb9c5b5af4f510d", "ja": "くふふ、やっぱりかっこいいぞ～……！\nこれならぜったい、みんなも欲しくなるぞ～！", "zh": "咕呼呼，果然很帅气呀～……！\n这样一来，大家肯定也会想要的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0554_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ead980c4e839e7dced970f7d663134709fc803850cd954239d3505ed097e77a0", "ja": "お疲れさま。おー、いいじゃないか！\n環にピッタリだな！", "zh": "辛苦了。哦——很不错嘛！\n和环非常合适！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0554_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "1fbe9a1ea27b25ba4f2484596418b5064d3e83016f8aa36489c413cca4b535a4", "ja": "ほんとに！？　やったー！\nたまきもね、すっごく気に入ってるんだ。", "zh": "真的！？太好了！\n环也特别喜欢哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0554_1004_040tam", "source_sha256": "2d67dda35eca06b40729886d4fe0f371be5ac6d96868ba088826f14f48006a1c", "ja": "シュッてしてるし、ヒラヒラのとこもいいよね！\nあとね、あとね……腕もかっこいいから好き！", "zh": "看起来又利落又帅气，飘飘的地方也很棒呢！\n还有啊，还有啊……手臂也很帅气，所以我喜欢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0554_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "67092f2d4a9db29e777a5194e148e8908737d643dc7dcc963f4a5a598a929061", "ja": "これなら、\nみんなもぜったい欲しくなるぞ～……くふふ♪", "zh": "这样一来，大家也绝对会想要的啦～……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0554_1006_p", "source_sha256": "131dbf25121e9be912b1dde5380ccc01ee70f620ed5b75442ddff21d165fb7db", "ja": "ははっ、そうだな。\nそれにメガネも、服の雰囲気に合ってイイ感じだ。", "zh": "哈哈，说得没错。\n而且眼镜也很适合这身衣服的风格，感觉很不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0554_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "827125b6e8ffb5e08a4b9d78afb4fe9eac407f7cdc60755ae56387992d8614de", "ja": "うんっ！\nほんとはね……たまき、メガネしてみたかったんだ。", "zh": "嗯！\n其实呢……环，早就想戴戴眼镜了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0554_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "33e350d96b2240f27619d0783d05ee1f3cc2194b409d86e8bc8fa553eda8af75", "ja": "さよこを見てると、すごくかっこいいんだもん！\nそれに、ヒーローの変身グッズみたいだよね♪", "zh": "看着纱代子，真的觉得好帅气啊！\n而且还像是英雄的变身道具呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0554_1009_040tam", "source_sha256": "e1133ccc708834ee5ddb0308ea176fa133605345d9c01dee5f27497d36099e6a", "ja": "メガネがない時はかわいくて、\nメガネをつけると、かっこいい大人モードになるの。", "zh": "不戴眼镜的时候很可爱，戴上眼镜后，就会变成帅气的大人模式。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0554_1010_p", "source_sha256": "0066c2bb04c3ff896f104eda96af284abdcd5dd698a0329ce6c7d984b4e20ed2", "ja": "大人モード……。もしかして、デザイナーさんに\n大人っぽくしたいって言ってたのは、それで？", "zh": "大人模式……难道跟设计师说\n想穿得成熟一点，就是因为这个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0554_1011_040tam", "source_sha256": "43115ffe8feb6632eba854640f631eec9c0ded4b2ddf17f41c06ec4bd33b314e", "ja": "うん。たまき、最近ね……\n大人っぽい服も似合うよって言われるんだ。", "zh": "嗯。环最近啊……\n总被人夸也很适合穿成熟一点的衣服呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0554_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "705eee4d0d5184ed4164a61fb27f5560ea87af47c516c977f04d2843ee3539fa", "ja": "デザイナーの人も、同じこと言ってたでしょ？\nだから、挑戦してみようかなって思ったの。", "zh": "设计师也这么说过吧？所以，我想要不要挑战一下呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0554_1013_p", "source_sha256": "c6d660452c07ed5c8c94af5bc0fe93ecf7837859aba1f738abde70f0dc341c0c", "ja": "そうか……。\n仕事で着るものは、大抵決まってたりするからな。", "zh": "这样啊……工作时要穿的衣服，大多都是固定的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0554_1014_p", "source_sha256": "709b1882bdaa31ee9d3ad6a147e9baf21ee6bc9bb4549d03b2562aef7c5abc8f", "ja": "この企画なら、環の着たい服を考えられるから、\nちょうどよかったみたいだな。", "zh": "看来这个企划正好能让我们考虑环想穿的衣服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0554_1015_040tam", "source_sha256": "7916cb8ffd536bc6934933fc87445fdc2473e1a8896422613aa120f5e04fcaef", "ja": "くふふ♪　……ねぇねぇおやぶん？\nたまき、かっこいい？　大人モードに見える？", "zh": "嘿嘿♪……喂喂，老大？\n环，帅不帅？看起来像大人模式吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0554_1016_p", "source_sha256": "946f086cde53d2201945e5c58fb45cdc89e543a4e7658b8714f7eb668dd84061", "ja": "うん、そうだな。総合的にはかわいいけど……\n大人モードで、すごくかっこいいぞ！", "zh": "嗯，确实呢。虽然整体来说很可爱……\n但在大人模式下，非常帅气哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0554_1017_040tam", "source_sha256": "abd2c6cf7bd5789e56be061698b8375ff4f1f30dcde7af9070ed10bfc9ca6272", "ja": "わーい！　かっこいいって言われたぞ～！\nあっ！　たまき、おやぶんのお仕事お手伝いしたい！", "zh": "太棒啦！被夸帅气了～！\n啊！环想帮老大分担工作！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0554_1018_p", "source_sha256": "109093af7854143a98402ae7565a4a5c8203ade0c379e9de058c177f0f4b05b5", "ja": "え？　それはありがたいけど……\n急にどうしたんだ？", "zh": "诶？那倒是谢谢你了……\n怎么突然想帮忙了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0554_1019_040tam", "source_sha256": "de1a431cfd01a225d2bf7a2d28dfdd31c72b8540e842bdee9b1bf0516ee9ff9d", "ja": "だって、ことりも、みさきも\nいつも、おやぶんのお手伝いしてるでしょ？", "zh": "因为，小鸟和美咲不是一直都在帮老大你的忙吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0554_1020_040tam", "source_sha256": "8fd176e83e6a99ed099b20407a9c53edbd6b501aa615ae597430413d71a2b570", "ja": "今のたまきは、大人だからね！\n当然、お手伝いするんだぞ～！", "zh": "现在的环可是大人了！\n当然要帮忙啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0554_1021_p", "source_sha256": "fa6967e6e5f6efb842aa13637b07ecd2bf5b87893a19707459ce9897bd2a6932", "ja": "（環には、音無さんや青羽さんの仕事姿が、\nそう見えてるんだな。二人に伝えたら喜びそうだ……）", "zh": "（原来在环眼里，音无小姐和青羽小姐工作的样子是这样的啊。要是告诉她们俩，她们应该会很高兴吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0554_1022_p", "source_sha256": "b27686842620ff2c17dc8de4245c94bed023d0c12c8b6cf85dd95775d2f8c1fa", "ja": "それじゃ、この後、その服の打ち合わせがあるから……\n環にも参加してもらおうかな？", "zh": "那么，接下来正好要商量那套服装的事……要不要也让环参加呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0554_1023_040tam", "source_sha256": "7df68f13068f99d59ca841830e858a39968f317fe4b3d45fa935e0d55610aa1c", "ja": "わかった！　頑張って、おやぶんのお手伝いするね。\n大人モードのたまきに任せていいぞ！　くふふ♪", "zh": "知道了！环会努力给老大帮忙的。\n交给出色大人模式的环就行啦！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
